# Frontend

- Next.js App Router, TypeScript strict mode, Tailwind CSS, and shadcn/ui components in `src/components/ui`.
- Server state stays on the server. Call EnergyOS through `src/lib/api`.
- Format displayed quantities with `src/lib/units.ts` and the `de-CH` locale.
- Keep workflow UI inside `src/features/<step>`.
- Do not call geo.admin, Sonnendach, ElCom, or other third-party energy APIs from the browser.
- Health and API errors keep the server's `code`, `message`, and `request_id`.
